---

## What This Project Is

A ground-up exploratory analysis of Uber's Delhi ride operations across all of 2024. The goal is not just to describe the data — it's to answer real business questions about where rides go wrong, where revenue is being left on the table, and what the numbers actually mean operationally.

The analysis covers 14 visualisation sections, statistical deep-dives, and ends with concrete recommendations backed by the data.

---

